#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "Wicket Financial Fields"
msgstr "Champs financiers Wicket"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://github.com/wicket/wicket-wp-financial-fields"
msgstr "https://github.com/wicket/wicket-wp-financial-fields"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "Finance mapping and deferred revenue system for WooCommerce orders. Provides GL code mapping, revenue deferral dates, and dynamic membership term date population."
msgstr "Système de correspondance financière et de produits reportés pour les commandes WooCommerce. Offre la correspondance des codes de grand livre, les dates de report des produits et le calcul dynamique des dates de période d'adhésion."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "Wicket Inc."
msgstr "Wicket Inc."

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://wicket.io"
msgstr "https://wicket.io"

